      "Path": "plugins/core/lib-ps/plugin-hook.ps1",
      "Line": 1174,
      "Commit": "6dbc384323c036a57c37fd9eaf2259879c1d956f",
      "Body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Complete the turn after consuming a stop override**\n\nFor an `in_progress` code-edit turn with a failed build or incomplete audit, consuming the corresponding acceptance marker returns immediately here, before the later `workflow.sessionlog.completeTurn` branch runs. The stop is therefore allowed while both the cache and authoritative session remain in progress, unlike the previous ordering where completion happened before enforcement; this leaves an unaudited stale turn for the next session. Treat the override as bypassing only its specific gate, then continue through turn completion.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L17-L19](https://github.com/sharpninja/McpServer/blob/6dbc384323c036a57c37fd9eaf2259879c1d956f/AGENTS.md#L17-L19)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
