51:     /// <summary>
52:     /// Rewrites workspace-key values of added and modified entities to the canonical form in place, so
53:     /// tracked instances returned by later queries carry the same value as the stored row. The comparer
54:     /// treats raw and canonical spellings as equal, so an ordinary current-value assignment would be
55:     /// ignored; the CLR member is written directly instead.
